<title>SWITZERLAND: SAirGroup details 1996 segment results.</title>
<headline>SAirGroup details 1996 segment results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAirGroup provided the following details of the 1996 results of its five business segments in its 1996 annual report: (in million Swiss francs):</p>
<p> Segment:	   Total	Operating   Invested    Personnel</p>
<p>			Revenue    Profit	Capital     (positions)</p>
<p> SAirLines	  4,361	79	    3,095	 10,202</p>
<p> SAirServices     1,841	99	    700	   6,521</p>
<p> SAirLogistics    1,043	11	    30	    1,942</p>
<p> SAirRelations    2,623	175	   1,500	 17,260</p>
<p> SAirGroup	  14	   20 loss     n.a.	  125</p>
<p> Total group	8,212	344	   5,440	 36,050</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
